#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:14 33f015cd5e8b45f180b1297a05fb4c5e
msgid ""
"The model is trained mostly on rural and suburban areas. Multi-task learning"
" keeps the road mask connected where trees or buildings hide the road. It "
"can fail in cities with wide roads, sidewalks and complex crossings."
msgstr "该模型主要基于农村和郊区数据训练。多任务学习可在树木或建筑遮挡道路处保持道路掩膜连通。在道路宽阔、有人行道且路口复杂的城市中可能失效。"

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:18 f2d85ef8cb91468e8380f98b278bfd78
msgid ""
"The model extracts road centrelines to reduce clutter, cleans the network, "
"then inflates the lines back into road polygons. Since version 1.1 the road "
"graph is post-processed:"
msgstr "模型先提取道路中心线以减少杂乱，清理路网，再将线条扩展回道路多边形。自 1.1 版起，道路路网图会进行后处理："

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:21 5fe53cf72ba241dcb2855f7c45905771
msgid "geometry simplification;"
msgstr "几何简化；"

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:22 9bc05d4d62d648d69e1ab8b5ebccdbd9
msgid "merging of gaps;"
msgstr "合并断口；"

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:23 48f0e27f02204a1f94855e79c89cd5c5
msgid "removal of double edges;"
msgstr "去除双边；"

#: ../userguides/roads_model.rst:24 76416510fefc409593a0346b19d9cfcd
msgid "removal of detached and too short segments."
msgstr "移除孤立和过短的路段。"

